# Refrain (as published by Leo Feist, 1913)
Peg o' my heart, I love you, We'll nev-er part, I love you,
E4/ G4/ A4/ B4/ ~B4(2) ~B4/ r/ A4 G4 E4 F#4/ A4/ C5/ E5/ ~E5(2) ~E5/ r/ D5 C5 A4
dear lit-tle girl, Sweet lit-tle girl,
A4/ G4/ D5/ A4/ ~A4 r A4/ G4/ D5/ A4/ ~A4 r
Sweet-er than the rose of Er-in, are your win-ning smiles en-dear-in',
E5/ B4/ D5/ C5/ E4/ G4/ B4/ A4/ G4/ G#4/ B4/ A4/ G4/ F#4/ F4/ D4/
Peg o' my heart, Your glan-ces with I-rish art en-trance us,
E4/ G4/ A4/ B4/ ~B4(2) ~B4/ r/ A4 G4 E4 F#4/ A4/ C5/ E5/ ~E5(2) ~E5/ r/ D5 C5 A4
Come, be my own, Come, make your home in my heart.
A4/ G4/ D5/ A4/ ~A4(2) A4/ G4/ D5/ A4/ ~A4/ G4/ E5 C5(2) ~C5(2) ~C5/ r/ r r(2)

